*Every ender can be done during cl.AC or cl.ACC.
*cl.AC first hit is cancellable by any follow-ups.
*During S.P.G, REV Blow can be used as an ender, during cl.AC only the second hit is REV Blow cancellable.
*D ender is REV Blow cancellable.
Auto combo that can only be used by starting with close A > 5C(And no other direction), none of these moves are special or super cancellable.<br>
----
cl.AC : First hit of the auto combo, cancellable by any follow-ups.
----
cl.AC > C : A second hit cancellable by any ender, a nice way to increase the damage or your opponent REV meter.<br>
Unsafe on block and can be punished if the auto-combo was started too close to the opponent.
----
D ender : Far D follow up, different frame data and damage, very unsafe on block but soft knockdown on hit.
----
6D ender : Safest ender, Same move as his Low Dodge Attack(5C+REV) but +2F on hit and block.
----
2D ender : Same move as his 2D, meaning it's very unsafe on block.
